  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DELIVERING TOGETHER IN SUPPORT OF THE 2030 AGENDA IN ETHIOPIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to One UN reform in Ethiopia. The programme aims at strengthening the implementation of UN Delivering As One. Specific objectives: strenghtening the One UN approcah to 1) Humanitarian-Development-Peace (HDP) nexus, resilience and climate action and 2) leaving no one behind.</narrative>
  </description>
